[I] WeeChat Matrix protocol script

[T] weechat-matrix is a Python script for the WeeChat chat client that lets
[T] it communicate over the decentralized Matrix protocol. It supports large
[T] parts of the protocol including end-to-end encryption and is in
[T] maintenance mode in favour of a Rust plugin rewrite.

[U] https://github.com/poljar/weechat-matrix

